    {
      "id": "nyc-highline-walk",
      "q": {
        "zh": "想在高线公园一带散步，顺便看看公共艺术",
        "en": "I want to walk around the High Line and see public art"
      },
      "a": {
        "zh": "高线公园是废弃高架铁路改成的空中步道，沿途有公共艺术与哈德逊河景，适合散步看公共艺术 [来源1]。惠特尼美国艺术博物馆露台正对哈德逊河与高线公园，可一并参观 [来源3]。切尔西市场紧邻高线公园，也可顺路前往 [来源2]。",
        "en": "The High Line is an elevated walkway converted from an abandoned railway, with public art and Hudson River views along the route [来源1]. Nearby, the Whitney Museum of American Art focuses on American contemporary art, and its terrace faces the Hudson River and the High Line [来源3]. Chelsea Market, a food market converted from an old cookie factory, is right next to the High Line [来源2]."
      },
